I don't have time to watch 
the fireworks with you!

18:29.040 --> 18:31.520
But you gave me five 
minutes at the hot springs!

18:31.520 --> 18:33.670
I thought that was the right thing to do!

18:33.670 --> 18:34.750
What about now?

18:34.750 --> 18:35.880
Sorry, I can't!

18:36.720 --> 18:38.280
Why?

18:38.280 --> 18:43.850
I spent all summer taking 
lots of videos for today.

18:44.550 --> 18:45.850
Mirika-san...

18:48.350 --> 18:49.690
I don't have time!

18:49.690 --> 18:51.440
Give me some attention for once!

18:51.800 --> 18:54.780
Do you know how much I love you?!

18:54.780 --> 18:57.280
But I love Saki-chan and Minase-san!

18:57.280 --> 18:58.650
What about me?!

18:58.650 --> 19:00.110
I'm not in love with you!

19:00.110 --> 19:03.580
Also, Naoya, is it just me, or are you 
not treating me too well lately?!

19:03.580 --> 19:05.780
Well, yeah, I want you to give up on me!

19:06.410 --> 19:10.080
You suck!

19:11.790 --> 19:13.580
Ow...

19:16.950 --> 19:18.720
Look at me!

19:22.550 --> 19:27.770
If you give me your attention and 
still don't fall for me, I'll let it go.

19:29.250 --> 19:34.540
I'll let Saki and the others have you 
for today if you don't have time.

19:35.890 --> 19:36.950
But...

19:38.280 --> 19:41.920
Just once in a while, just for a little bit...

19:41.920 --> 19:44.240
Give me your time.

19:50.050 --> 19:53.830
I want to use all my time for her.

19:55.040 --> 19:56.000
Well...

19:56.760 --> 19:58.960
You said you're a fan of mine, didn't you?

19:58.960 --> 20:02.800
All those videos I was taking 
were camping videos!

20:02.800 --> 20:07.010
I took them thinking it'd be 
really fun to go camping with you.

20:07.010 --> 20:09.720
I worked really hard on the editing, too.

20:09.720 --> 20:13.190
I guarantee they'll make you 
want to go camping with me!

20:13.600 --> 20:15.830
Then you and I can...

20:16.730 --> 20:19.210
The others can come along.

20:19.210 --> 20:20.490
I haven't watched them.

20:21.920 --> 20:27.870
I've stopped watching your videos, Mirika-san.

20:31.410 --> 20:33.500
You're kidding... right?

20:35.080 --> 20:36.580
I wouldn't lie.

20:45.890 --> 20:47.710
Oh, no...

20:47.710 --> 20:51.740
Why am I crying?

20:58.700 --> 21:02.110
Are my videos not good anymore?

21:02.110 --> 21:05.560
I'll work even harder to make 
them fun to watch, then!

21:05.560 --> 21:07.030
That's not it.

21:07.590 --> 21:10.860
D-Do you hate me now?

21:10.860 --> 21:12.290
I admire you.

21:15.330 --> 21:18.420
Then why are you so...

21:25.320 --> 21:30.120
I can't let myself fall in love with you.

21:40.180 --> 21:42.260
So... I'm sorry.

21:46.240 --> 21:49.030
D-Does that mean...

21:56.080 --> 22:02.360
Does that mean Naoya notices me?

22:05.780 --> 22:07.840
The fireworks are starting!

22:07.840 --> 22:10.640
Where is Naoya?

22:10.640 --> 22:13.180
The fireworks are supposed 
to last half an hour.

22:13.180 --> 22:14.480
Let's split up and find him.

22:14.480 --> 22:15.810
We can still make it.

22:15.810 --> 22:17.340
Y-You're right.

22:17.340 --> 22:19.000
I'll go this way, then.

22:19.000 --> 22:19.840
Okay.

22:19.840 --> 22:22.760
Let's meet up at that park 
there in twenty minutes.

22:22.760 --> 22:23.550
Okay.

22:23.550 --> 22:24.280
Hey!

22:29.800 --> 22:32.710
I have an idea.

22:33.990 --> 22:37.000
<b>All right!!</b>

22:33.990 --> 22:37.000
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

22:34.360 --> 22:35.800
All right!

22:37.000 --> 22:42.000
<b>Get Yourself Together</b>

24:13.250 --> 24:14.680
Next episode preview, here we go!

24:14.680 --> 24:17.100
The gist is that Nagisa-san's 
going to be really bold!

24:17.100 --> 24:19.070
What?! I'm gonna do <i>that</i>?!

24:19.070 --> 24:20.730
Risa's all flustered now!

24:20.730 --> 24:23.020
P-Please don't watch the next episode!

24:23.020 --> 24:24.520
Be sure to watch it!
